# Default-deny context. Include only runtime sources, public fixtures and provenance.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!apps/
!apps/**
!adapters/
!adapters/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!config/
!config/**
!deploy/
!deploy/**
!dashboard/
!dashboard/**
!data/
data/*
!data/public/
!data/public/**
!data/research/
!data/research/**
!data/current_fields/
!data/current_fields/**
!data/sample_runs/
!data/sample_runs/**
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/research-evidence/
docs/research-evidence/*
!docs/research-evidence/matched-current-metadata/
!docs/research-evidence/matched-current-metadata/**
!docs/research-evidence/matched-current-v1-compatibility-diagnosis.json
!docs/matched-current-v2-amendment.md

# Re-exclude private configuration and generated files even under included paths.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.next
**/.next/**
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/private/**
**/secrets/**
**/credentials/**
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.db
**/*.pyc
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
data/local/**
data/runs/**
